{"id":"n72034-2-7","stage":3,"title":"채널 · 频道","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72034-2-7-1","ko":"잘 보고 있는데 왜 다른 채널로 바꿔?","zh":"我正在好好看呢，为什么要换到别的频道啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보고","meaning":"看，观看，观赏","explanation":"보다：看，观看，观赏；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있는데","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다른","meaning":"其他，别的","explanation":"다른：其他，别的","readings":[{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64530","senseId":"1","lemma":"다른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"채널로","meaning":"频道，台","explanation":"채널：频道，台；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"채널","audio":"/audio/a391a59a3eb680f8745e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72034","senseId":"2","lemma":"채널","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바꿔?","meaning":"换，更换，调换","explanation":"바꾸다：换，更换，调换；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"바꾸다","audio":"/audio/5cc3393b01c955d1c3fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17198","senseId":"1","lemma":"바꾸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","